<title>NETHERLANDS: New Dutch 2007-tap issue priced raised to 100.70.</title>
<headline>New Dutch 2007-tap issue priced raised to 100.70.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1997-01-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Finance Ministry on Monday raised the price of the government's new 5.75 percent bond due February 2007 to 100.70 guilders from the initial price of 100.65.</p>
<p>Tap sales will continue daily from 0800 GMT until further notice.</p>
<p>Last Friday the Dutch state said it was to issue a 10-year Dutch state loan, the first new 10-year Dutch state loan for more than a year.</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom +31 20 504 5000</p>
